# LeakSanitizer suppressions for allocations this project does not own.
#
# Qt Network asks the system for its proxy configuration on the first request
# (QNetworkProxyFactory::systemProxyForQuery). On distributions that ship the
# libproxy backend, that call leaks a handful of small glib allocations inside
# libproxy itself. The leak is in third-party code, is bounded and happens once
# per process, so it is suppressed here rather than hiding leaks of our own.
leak:libpxbackend
leak:libproxy
